			<title>This is the “do you condemn Hassan Piker” strategy all over again and we know how to respond to it:</title>
			<link>https://www.facebook.com/reel/2360817557791451/</link>
			<description>This is the “do you condemn Hassan Piker” strategy all over again and we know how to respond to it:&lt;br&gt;
- We don’t engage with the right-wing framing.&lt;br&gt;
- We call out the right-wing framing.&lt;br&gt;
- We don’t answer the question as asked.&lt;br&gt;
- We ask why the question was asked.&lt;br&gt;
- We point out the hypocrisy and ask them to condemn their own lies and nonsense.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
